{"id":"acbd9c4756abbc20","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-VF-conservative.md","title":"VF 对 PA 的非保守性及明确分离句","display":"thm-VF-conservative — VF 对 PA 的非保守性及明确分离句","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-VF-conservative","aliases":["91-thm-VF-conservative","91-thm-VF-conservative-extension","91-thm-supervaluation-conservative"],"display":"thm-VF-conservative — VF 对 PA 的非保守性及明确分离句","depends_on":["[[91-df-VF]]","[[91-df-positive-inductive-definition]]","[[91-df-consistency-predicate]]","[[91-df-conservative-truth]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-VF-conservative"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-VF-conservative</span><span>91-thm-VF-conservative-extension</span><span>91-thm-supervaluation-conservative</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-VF-conservative — VF 对 PA 的非保守性及明确分离句"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"669ee474b9646a38\" href=\"?note=669ee474b9646a38\" title=\"91-df-VF\">91-df-VF</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7a804bf41cb20efd\" href=\"?note=7a804bf41cb20efd\" title=\"91-df-positive-inductive-definition\">91-df-positive-inductive-definition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4e50c115b0d32044\" href=\"?note=4e50c115b0d32044\" title=\"91-df-consistency-predicate\">91-df-consistency-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4a1d989a5f615933\" href=\"?note=4a1d989a5f615933\" title=\"91-df-conservative-truth\">91-df-conservative-truth</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 为基础算术；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4a1d989a5f615933\" href=\"?note=4a1d989a5f615933\" title=\"91-df-conservative-truth\">91-df-conservative-truth</a> 的保守性谓词。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VF}\">\\(\\mathrm{VF}\\)</span> 是本目录核对的 Cantini 系统，含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}_T\\)</span>、其公理为真、真理 modus ponens、统一 T-out；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> 为自然证明谓词的一致性句。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\mathcal C=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span>；PA 一致，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span> 为算术后果等价，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ID}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{ID}_1\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"7a804bf41cb20efd\" href=\"?note=7a804bf41cb20efd\" title=\"91-df-positive-inductive-definition\">91-df-positive-inductive-definition</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}VF\\text{-}conservative}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{VF}\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{ID}_1,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{VF}\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{PA}),\n\\qquad\\mathrm{PA}\\nvdash\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{PA}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}VF\\text{-}conservative}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{VF}\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{ID}_1,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{VF}\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{PA}),\n\\qquad\\mathrm{PA}\\nvdash\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{PA}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathrm{VF},\\mathrm{PA}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathrm{VF},\\mathrm{PA}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书第 18 章给出 VF 的 PA<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"_T\">\\(_T\\)</span> 全局反射性质；在本目录补充核对的九组公理表述中，以公理为真、真理 modus ponens、量词规则保持真及全归纳验证证明序列可得该性质。由统一 T-out 排除矛盾为真，推出 PA<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"_T\">\\(_T\\)</span> 及 PA 的一致性。第二不完备定理给出最后分离，故非保守。\n与 ID<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"_1\">\\(_1\\)</span> 的完整算术等价是原书转述 Cantini 的证明论分析，本目录未另造其数百页背景归约证明。文件名 conservative 为历史链接，结论是否定该性质。</p>\n<p>来源：第 18 章，印刷页 251–252，PDF 页 262–263；Cantini（1990）的 ID1 校准。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-VF","status":"resolved","id":"669ee474b9646a38","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-VF]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-positive-inductive-definition","status":"resolved","id":"7a804bf41cb20efd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-positive-inductive-definition]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-consistency-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"4e50c115b0d32044","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-consistency-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-conservative-truth","status":"resolved","id":"4a1d989a5f615933","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-conservative-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-conservative-truth","status":"resolved","id":"4a1d989a5f615933","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PA}$ 为基础算术；$\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}$ 为 [[91-df-conservative-truth]] 的保守性谓词。","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-positive-inductive-definition","status":"resolved","id":"7a804bf41cb20efd","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}$；PA 一致，$\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}$ 为算术后果等价，$\\mathrm{ID}_1$ 见 [[91-df-positive-inductive-definition]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{VF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ID}_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}VF\\text{-}conservative}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{VF}\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{ID}_1,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{VF}\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{PA}),\n\\qquad\\mathrm{PA}\\nvdash\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{PA}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathrm{VF},\\mathrm{PA}).","display":true},{"tex":"_T","display":false},{"tex":"_T","display":false},{"tex":"_1","display":false}],"bytes":1998,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-161","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-VF-conservative]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-137","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-CT-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-necessity-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-omega-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-strength.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-soundness.md]]\n[[91-thm-McGee.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-partial-recovery.md]]\n[[91-thm-TB-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-Tarski-undefinability.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-compositional-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-conservative-extension-axioms.md]]\n[[91-thm-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-existence.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-lattice.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-non-uniqueness.md]]\n[[91-thm-hierarchical-truth-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-iteration-convergence.md]]\n[[91-thm-kripke-jump-iteration.md]]\n[[91-thm-liar-not-provable.md]]\n[[91-thm-liar-sentence-properties.md]]\n[[91-thm-numeral-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-positive-induction-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-reflection-from-truth.md]]\n[[91-thm-revision-convergence.md]]\n[[91-thm-soundness-equivalence.md]]\n[[91-thm-stable-sentence-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-induction-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-iteration-stability.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-definability-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-non-creativity.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-stronger-than-provability.md]]\n[[91-thm-typed-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-untyped-nonconservative.md]]"}],"outgoing":["669ee474b9646a38","7a804bf41cb20efd","4e50c115b0d32044","4a1d989a5f615933"]}